[{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-VL/qwen3vl-head.png#center","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-VL/qwen3vl-head.png#center\" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://chat.qwenlm.ai","label":"QWEN CHAT","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://chat.qwenlm.ai\" label=\"QWEN CHAT\" external=true >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3-VL","label":"GITHUB","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3-VL\" label=\"GITHUB\" external=true >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://huggingface.co/collections/Qwen/qwen3-vl-68d2a7c1b8a8afce4ebd2dbe","label":"HUGGING FACE","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://huggingface.co/collections/Qwen/qwen3-vl-68d2a7c1b8a8afce4ebd2dbe\" label=\"HUGGING FACE\" external=true >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://modelscope.cn/collections/Qwen3-VL-5c7a94c8cb144b","label":"MODELSCOPE","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://modelscope.cn/collections/Qwen3-VL-5c7a94c8cb144b\" label=\"MODELSCOPE\" external=true >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://discord.gg/yPEP2vHTu4","label":"DISCORD","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://discord.gg/yPEP2vHTu4\" label=\"DISCORD\" external=true >}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Today, we officially launch the all-new Qwen3-VL series — the most powerful vision-language model in the Qwen family to date. In this generation, we’ve made major improvements across multiple dimensions: whether it’s understanding and generating text, perceiving and reasoning about visual content, supporting longer context lengths, understanding spatial relationships and dynamic videos, or interacting with AI agents — Qwen3-VL shows clear and significant progress in every area.","text":"Today, we officially launch the all-new Qwen3-VL series — the most powerful vision-language model in the Qwen family to date. In this generation, we’ve made major improvements across multiple dimensions: whether it’s understanding and generating text, perceiving and reasoning about visual content, supporting longer context lengths, understanding spatial relationships and dynamic videos, or interacting with AI agents — Qwen3-VL shows clear and significant progress in every area.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Today, we officially launch the all-new Qwen3-VL series — the most powerful vision-language model in the Qwen family to date. In this generation, we’ve made major improvements across multiple dimensions: whether it’s understanding and generating text, perceiving and reasoning about visual content, supporting longer context lengths, understanding spatial relationships and dynamic videos, or interacting with AI agents — Qwen3-VL shows clear and significant progress in every area.","text":"Today, we officially launch the all-new Qwen3-VL series — the most powerful vision-language model in the Qwen family to date. In this generation, we’ve made major improvements across multiple dimensions: whether it’s understanding and generating text, perceiving and reasoning about visual content, supporting longer context lengths, understanding spatial relationships and dynamic videos, or interacting with AI agents — Qwen3-VL shows clear and significant progress in every area.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Firstly, we are open-sourcing the flagship model of this series: Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B, available in both Instruct and Thinking versions. The Instruct version matches or even exceeds Gemini 2.5 Pro in major visual perception benchmarks. The Thinking version achieves state-of-the-art results across many multimodal reasoning benchmarks.","text":"Firstly, we are open-sourcing the flagship model of this series: Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B, available in both Instruct and Thinking versions. The Instruct version matches or even exceeds Gemini 2.5 Pro in major visual perception benchmarks. The Thinking version achieves state-of-the-art results across many multimodal reasoning benchmarks.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Firstly, we are open-sourcing the flagship model of this series: Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B, available in both Instruct and Thinking versions. The Instruct version matches or even exceeds Gemini 2.5 Pro in major visual perception benchmarks. The Thinking version achieves state-of-the-art results across many multimodal reasoning benchmarks.","text":"Firstly, we are open-sourcing the flagship model of this series: Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B, available in both Instruct and Thinking versions. The Instruct version matches or even exceeds Gemini 2.5 Pro in major visual perception benchmarks. The Thinking version achieves state-of-the-art results across many multimodal reasoning benchmarks.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"hr","raw":"---"},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"The goal of Qwen3-VL is not just to \"see\" images or videos — but to truly understand the world, interpret events, and take action. To achieve this, we’ve systematically upgraded key capabilities, pushing visual models from simple “perception” toward deeper \"cognition\", and from basic \"recognition\" to advanced “reasoning and execution.”","text":"The goal of Qwen3-VL is not just to \"see\" images or videos — but to truly understand the world, interpret events, and take action. To achieve this, we’ve systematically upgraded key capabilities, pushing visual models from simple “perception” toward deeper \"cognition\", and from basic \"recognition\" to advanced “reasoning and execution.”","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"The goal of Qwen3-VL is not just to \"see\" images or videos — but to truly understand the world, interpret events, and take action. To achieve this, we’ve systematically upgraded key capabilities, pushing visual models from simple “perception” toward deeper \"cognition\", and from basic \"recognition\" to advanced “reasoning and execution.”","text":"The goal of Qwen3-VL is not just to \"see\" images or videos — but to truly understand the world, interpret events, and take action. To achieve this, we’ve systematically upgraded key capabilities, pushing visual models from simple “perception” toward deeper \"cognition\", and from basic \"recognition\" to advanced “reasoning and execution.”","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"## **Key Highlights:**\n\n","depth":2,"text":"**Key Highlights:**","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Key Highlights:**","text":"Key Highlights:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Key Highlights:","text":"Key Highlights:","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list","raw":"- **Visual Agent Capabilities**: Qwen3-VL can operate computer and mobile interfaces — recognize GUI elements, understand button functions, call tools, and complete tasks. It achieves top global performance on benchmarks like OS World, and using tools significantly improves its performance on fine-grained perception tasks.\n\n- **Superior Text-Centric Performance**: Qwen3-VL employs early-stage joint pretraining of text and visual modalities, continuously strengthening its language capabilities. Its performance on text-based tasks matches that of Qwen3-235B-A22B-2507 — the flagship language model — making it a truly “text-grounded, multimodal powerhouse” for the next generation of vision-language models.\n\n- **Greatly Improved Visual Coding**: It can now generate code from images or videos — for example, turning a design mockup into Draw.io, HTML, CSS, or JavaScript code — making “what you see is what you get” visual programming a reality.\n\n- **Much Better Spatial Understanding**: 2D grounding from absolute coordinates to relative coordinates. It can judge object positions, viewpoint changes, and occlusion relationships. It supports 3D grounding, laying the foundation for complex spatial reasoning and embodied AI applications.\n\n- **Long Context & Long Video Understanding**: All models natively support 256K tokens of context, expandable up to 1 million tokens. This means you can input hundreds of pages of technical documents, entire textbooks, or even two-hour videos — and the model will remember everything and retrieve details accurately, down to the exact second in videos.\n\n- **Stronger Multimodal Reasoning (Thinking Version)**: The Thinking model is specially optimized for STEM and math reasoning. When facing complex subject questions, it can notice fine details, break down problems step by step, analyze cause and effect, and give logical, evidence-based answers. It achieves strong performance on reasoning benchmarks like MathVision, MMMU, and MathVista.\n\n- **Upgraded Visual Perception & Recognition**: By improving the quality and diversity of pre-training data, the model can now recognize a much wider range of objects — from celebrities, anime characters, products, and landmarks, to animals and plants — covering both everyday life and professional “recognize anything” needs.\n\n- **Better OCR Across More Languages & Complex Scenes**: OCR now supports 32 languages (up from 10), covering more countries and regions. It performs more reliably under challenging real-world conditions like poor lighting, blur, or tilted text. Recognition accuracy for rare characters, ancient scripts, and technical terms has also improved significantly. Its ability to understand long documents and reconstruct fine structures is further enhanced.","ordered":false,"start":"","loose":true,"items":[{"type":"list_item","raw":"- **Visual Agent Capabilities**: Qwen3-VL can operate computer and mobile interfaces — recognize GUI elements, understand button functions, call tools, and complete tasks. It achieves top global performance on benchmarks like OS World, and using tools significantly improves its performance on fine-grained perception tasks.\n\n","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**Visual Agent Capabilities**: Qwen3-VL can operate computer and mobile interfaces — recognize GUI elements, understand button functions, call tools, and complete tasks. It achieves top global performance on benchmarks like OS World, and using tools significantly improves its performance on fine-grained perception tasks.\n","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Visual Agent Capabilities**: Qwen3-VL can operate computer and mobile interfaces — recognize GUI elements, understand button functions, call tools, and complete tasks. It achieves top global performance on benchmarks like OS World, and using tools significantly improves its performance on fine-grained perception tasks.\n","text":"**Visual Agent Capabilities**: Qwen3-VL can operate computer and mobile interfaces — recognize GUI elements, understand button functions, call tools, and complete tasks. It achieves top global performance on benchmarks like OS World, and using tools significantly improves its performance on fine-grained perception tasks.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Visual Agent Capabilities**","text":"Visual Agent Capabilities","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Visual Agent Capabilities","text":"Visual Agent Capabilities","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": Qwen3-VL can operate computer and mobile interfaces — recognize GUI elements, understand button functions, call tools, and complete tasks. It achieves top global performance on benchmarks like OS World, and using tools significantly improves its performance on fine-grained perception tasks.","text":": Qwen3-VL can operate computer and mobile interfaces — recognize GUI elements, understand button functions, call tools, and complete tasks. It achieves top global performance on benchmarks like OS World, and using tools significantly improves its performance on fine-grained perception tasks.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"- **Superior Text-Centric Performance**: Qwen3-VL employs early-stage joint pretraining of text and visual modalities, continuously strengthening its language capabilities. Its performance on text-based tasks matches that of Qwen3-235B-A22B-2507 — the flagship language model — making it a truly “text-grounded, multimodal powerhouse” for the next generation of vision-language models.\n\n","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**Superior Text-Centric Performance**: Qwen3-VL employs early-stage joint pretraining of text and visual modalities, continuously strengthening its language capabilities. Its performance on text-based tasks matches that of Qwen3-235B-A22B-2507 — the flagship language model — making it a truly “text-grounded, multimodal powerhouse” for the next generation of vision-language models.\n","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Superior Text-Centric Performance**: Qwen3-VL employs early-stage joint pretraining of text and visual modalities, continuously strengthening its language capabilities. Its performance on text-based tasks matches that of Qwen3-235B-A22B-2507 — the flagship language model — making it a truly “text-grounded, multimodal powerhouse” for the next generation of vision-language models.\n","text":"**Superior Text-Centric Performance**: Qwen3-VL employs early-stage joint pretraining of text and visual modalities, continuously strengthening its language capabilities. Its performance on text-based tasks matches that of Qwen3-235B-A22B-2507 — the flagship language model — making it a truly “text-grounded, multimodal powerhouse” for the next generation of vision-language models.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Superior Text-Centric Performance**","text":"Superior Text-Centric Performance","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Superior Text-Centric Performance","text":"Superior Text-Centric Performance","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": Qwen3-VL employs early-stage joint pretraining of text and visual modalities, continuously strengthening its language capabilities. Its performance on text-based tasks matches that of Qwen3-235B-A22B-2507 — the flagship language model — making it a truly “text-grounded, multimodal powerhouse” for the next generation of vision-language models.","text":": Qwen3-VL employs early-stage joint pretraining of text and visual modalities, continuously strengthening its language capabilities. Its performance on text-based tasks matches that of Qwen3-235B-A22B-2507 — the flagship language model — making it a truly “text-grounded, multimodal powerhouse” for the next generation of vision-language models.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"- **Greatly Improved Visual Coding**: It can now generate code from images or videos — for example, turning a design mockup into Draw.io, HTML, CSS, or JavaScript code — making “what you see is what you get” visual programming a reality.\n\n","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**Greatly Improved Visual Coding**: It can now generate code from images or videos — for example, turning a design mockup into Draw.io, HTML, CSS, or JavaScript code — making “what you see is what you get” visual programming a reality.\n","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Greatly Improved Visual Coding**: It can now generate code from images or videos — for example, turning a design mockup into Draw.io, HTML, CSS, or JavaScript code — making “what you see is what you get” visual programming a reality.\n","text":"**Greatly Improved Visual Coding**: It can now generate code from images or videos — for example, turning a design mockup into Draw.io, HTML, CSS, or JavaScript code — making “what you see is what you get” visual programming a reality.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Greatly Improved Visual Coding**","text":"Greatly Improved Visual Coding","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Greatly Improved Visual Coding","text":"Greatly Improved Visual Coding","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": It can now generate code from images or videos — for example, turning a design mockup into Draw.io, HTML, CSS, or JavaScript code — making “what you see is what you get” visual programming a reality.","text":": It can now generate code from images or videos — for example, turning a design mockup into Draw.io, HTML, CSS, or JavaScript code — making “what you see is what you get” visual programming a reality.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"- **Much Better Spatial Understanding**: 2D grounding from absolute coordinates to relative coordinates. It can judge object positions, viewpoint changes, and occlusion relationships. It supports 3D grounding, laying the foundation for complex spatial reasoning and embodied AI applications.\n\n","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**Much Better Spatial Understanding**: 2D grounding from absolute coordinates to relative coordinates. It can judge object positions, viewpoint changes, and occlusion relationships. It supports 3D grounding, laying the foundation for complex spatial reasoning and embodied AI applications.\n","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Much Better Spatial Understanding**: 2D grounding from absolute coordinates to relative coordinates. It can judge object positions, viewpoint changes, and occlusion relationships. It supports 3D grounding, laying the foundation for complex spatial reasoning and embodied AI applications.\n","text":"**Much Better Spatial Understanding**: 2D grounding from absolute coordinates to relative coordinates. It can judge object positions, viewpoint changes, and occlusion relationships. It supports 3D grounding, laying the foundation for complex spatial reasoning and embodied AI applications.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Much Better Spatial Understanding**","text":"Much Better Spatial Understanding","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Much Better Spatial Understanding","text":"Much Better Spatial Understanding","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": 2D grounding from absolute coordinates to relative coordinates. It can judge object positions, viewpoint changes, and occlusion relationships. It supports 3D grounding, laying the foundation for complex spatial reasoning and embodied AI applications.","text":": 2D grounding from absolute coordinates to relative coordinates. It can judge object positions, viewpoint changes, and occlusion relationships. It supports 3D grounding, laying the foundation for complex spatial reasoning and embodied AI applications.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"- **Long Context & Long Video Understanding**: All models natively support 256K tokens of context, expandable up to 1 million tokens. This means you can input hundreds of pages of technical documents, entire textbooks, or even two-hour videos — and the model will remember everything and retrieve details accurately, down to the exact second in videos.\n\n","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**Long Context & Long Video Understanding**: All models natively support 256K tokens of context, expandable up to 1 million tokens. This means you can input hundreds of pages of technical documents, entire textbooks, or even two-hour videos — and the model will remember everything and retrieve details accurately, down to the exact second in videos.\n","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Long Context & Long Video Understanding**: All models natively support 256K tokens of context, expandable up to 1 million tokens. This means you can input hundreds of pages of technical documents, entire textbooks, or even two-hour videos — and the model will remember everything and retrieve details accurately, down to the exact second in videos.\n","text":"**Long Context & Long Video Understanding**: All models natively support 256K tokens of context, expandable up to 1 million tokens. This means you can input hundreds of pages of technical documents, entire textbooks, or even two-hour videos — and the model will remember everything and retrieve details accurately, down to the exact second in videos.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Long Context & Long Video Understanding**","text":"Long Context & Long Video Understanding","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Long Context & Long Video Understanding","text":"Long Context & Long Video Understanding","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": All models natively support 256K tokens of context, expandable up to 1 million tokens. This means you can input hundreds of pages of technical documents, entire textbooks, or even two-hour videos — and the model will remember everything and retrieve details accurately, down to the exact second in videos.","text":": All models natively support 256K tokens of context, expandable up to 1 million tokens. This means you can input hundreds of pages of technical documents, entire textbooks, or even two-hour videos — and the model will remember everything and retrieve details accurately, down to the exact second in videos.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"- **Stronger Multimodal Reasoning (Thinking Version)**: The Thinking model is specially optimized for STEM and math reasoning. When facing complex subject questions, it can notice fine details, break down problems step by step, analyze cause and effect, and give logical, evidence-based answers. It achieves strong performance on reasoning benchmarks like MathVision, MMMU, and MathVista.\n\n","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**Stronger Multimodal Reasoning (Thinking Version)**: The Thinking model is specially optimized for STEM and math reasoning. When facing complex subject questions, it can notice fine details, break down problems step by step, analyze cause and effect, and give logical, evidence-based answers. It achieves strong performance on reasoning benchmarks like MathVision, MMMU, and MathVista.\n","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Stronger Multimodal Reasoning (Thinking Version)**: The Thinking model is specially optimized for STEM and math reasoning. When facing complex subject questions, it can notice fine details, break down problems step by step, analyze cause and effect, and give logical, evidence-based answers. It achieves strong performance on reasoning benchmarks like MathVision, MMMU, and MathVista.\n","text":"**Stronger Multimodal Reasoning (Thinking Version)**: The Thinking model is specially optimized for STEM and math reasoning. When facing complex subject questions, it can notice fine details, break down problems step by step, analyze cause and effect, and give logical, evidence-based answers. It achieves strong performance on reasoning benchmarks like MathVision, MMMU, and MathVista.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Stronger Multimodal Reasoning (Thinking Version)**","text":"Stronger Multimodal Reasoning (Thinking Version)","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Stronger Multimodal Reasoning (Thinking Version)","text":"Stronger Multimodal Reasoning (Thinking Version)","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": The Thinking model is specially optimized for STEM and math reasoning. When facing complex subject questions, it can notice fine details, break down problems step by step, analyze cause and effect, and give logical, evidence-based answers. It achieves strong performance on reasoning benchmarks like MathVision, MMMU, and MathVista.","text":": The Thinking model is specially optimized for STEM and math reasoning. When facing complex subject questions, it can notice fine details, break down problems step by step, analyze cause and effect, and give logical, evidence-based answers. It achieves strong performance on reasoning benchmarks like MathVision, MMMU, and MathVista.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"- **Upgraded Visual Perception & Recognition**: By improving the quality and diversity of pre-training data, the model can now recognize a much wider range of objects — from celebrities, anime characters, products, and landmarks, to animals and plants — covering both everyday life and professional “recognize anything” needs.\n\n","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**Upgraded Visual Perception & Recognition**: By improving the quality and diversity of pre-training data, the model can now recognize a much wider range of objects — from celebrities, anime characters, products, and landmarks, to animals and plants — covering both everyday life and professional “recognize anything” needs.\n","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Upgraded Visual Perception & Recognition**: By improving the quality and diversity of pre-training data, the model can now recognize a much wider range of objects — from celebrities, anime characters, products, and landmarks, to animals and plants — covering both everyday life and professional “recognize anything” needs.\n","text":"**Upgraded Visual Perception & Recognition**: By improving the quality and diversity of pre-training data, the model can now recognize a much wider range of objects — from celebrities, anime characters, products, and landmarks, to animals and plants — covering both everyday life and professional “recognize anything” needs.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Upgraded Visual Perception & Recognition**","text":"Upgraded Visual Perception & Recognition","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Upgraded Visual Perception & Recognition","text":"Upgraded Visual Perception & Recognition","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": By improving the quality and diversity of pre-training data, the model can now recognize a much wider range of objects — from celebrities, anime characters, products, and landmarks, to animals and plants — covering both everyday life and professional “recognize anything” needs.","text":": By improving the quality and diversity of pre-training data, the model can now recognize a much wider range of objects — from celebrities, anime characters, products, and landmarks, to animals and plants — covering both everyday life and professional “recognize anything” needs.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"- **Better OCR Across More Languages & Complex Scenes**: OCR now supports 32 languages (up from 10), covering more countries and regions. It performs more reliably under challenging real-world conditions like poor lighting, blur, or tilted text. Recognition accuracy for rare characters, ancient scripts, and technical terms has also improved significantly. Its ability to understand long documents and reconstruct fine structures is further enhanced.","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**Better OCR Across More Languages & Complex Scenes**: OCR now supports 32 languages (up from 10), covering more countries and regions. It performs more reliably under challenging real-world conditions like poor lighting, blur, or tilted text. Recognition accuracy for rare characters, ancient scripts, and technical terms has also improved significantly. Its ability to understand long documents and reconstruct fine structures is further enhanced.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Better OCR Across More Languages & Complex Scenes**: OCR now supports 32 languages (up from 10), covering more countries and regions. It performs more reliably under challenging real-world conditions like poor lighting, blur, or tilted text. Recognition accuracy for rare characters, ancient scripts, and technical terms has also improved significantly. Its ability to understand long documents and reconstruct fine structures is further enhanced.","text":"**Better OCR Across More Languages & Complex Scenes**: OCR now supports 32 languages (up from 10), covering more countries and regions. It performs more reliably under challenging real-world conditions like poor lighting, blur, or tilted text. Recognition accuracy for rare characters, ancient scripts, and technical terms has also improved significantly. Its ability to understand long documents and reconstruct fine structures is further enhanced.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Better OCR Across More Languages & Complex Scenes**","text":"Better OCR Across More Languages & Complex Scenes","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Better OCR Across More Languages & Complex Scenes","text":"Better OCR Across More Languages & Complex Scenes","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": OCR now supports 32 languages (up from 10), covering more countries and regions. It performs more reliably under challenging real-world conditions like poor lighting, blur, or tilted text. Recognition accuracy for rare characters, ancient scripts, and technical terms has also improved significantly. Its ability to understand long documents and reconstruct fine structures is further enhanced.","text":": OCR now supports 32 languages (up from 10), covering more countries and regions. It performs more reliably under challenging real-world conditions like poor lighting, blur, or tilted text. Recognition accuracy for rare characters, ancient scripts, and technical terms has also improved significantly. Its ability to understand long documents and reconstruct fine structures is further enhanced.","escaped":false}]}]}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hr","raw":"---"},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"## Model Performance\n\n","depth":2,"text":"Model Performance","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Model Performance","text":"Model Performance","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"We comprehensively evaluated the model's visual capabilities across ten dimensions, covering university-level comprehensive problems, mathematical and scientific reasoning, logic puzzles, general visual question answering, subjective experience and instruction following, multilingual text recognition and chart/document parsing, 2D/3D object grounding, multi-image understanding, embodied and spatial perception, video understanding, agent task execution, and code generation. Overall, Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct achieves top performance on most metrics among non-reasoning models, significantly outperforming closed-source models such as Gemini 2.5 Pro and GPT-5, while also setting new state-of-the-art results among open-source multimodal models, demonstrating its strong generalization ability and comprehensive performance on complex visual tasks.","text":"We comprehensively evaluated the model's visual capabilities across ten dimensions, covering university-level comprehensive problems, mathematical and scientific reasoning, logic puzzles, general visual question answering, subjective experience and instruction following, multilingual text recognition and chart/document parsing, 2D/3D object grounding, multi-image understanding, embodied and spatial perception, video understanding, agent task execution, and code generation. Overall, Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct achieves top performance on most metrics among non-reasoning models, significantly outperforming closed-source models such as Gemini 2.5 Pro and GPT-5, while also setting new state-of-the-art results among open-source multimodal models, demonstrating its strong generalization ability and comprehensive performance on complex visual tasks.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"We comprehensively evaluated the model's visual capabilities across ten dimensions, covering university-level comprehensive problems, mathematical and scientific reasoning, logic puzzles, general visual question answering, subjective experience and instruction following, multilingual text recognition and chart/document parsing, 2D/3D object grounding, multi-image understanding, embodied and spatial perception, video understanding, agent task execution, and code generation. Overall, Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct achieves top performance on most metrics among non-reasoning models, significantly outperforming closed-source models such as Gemini 2.5 Pro and GPT-5, while also setting new state-of-the-art results among open-source multimodal models, demonstrating its strong generalization ability and comprehensive performance on complex visual tasks.","text":"We comprehensively evaluated the model's visual capabilities across ten dimensions, covering university-level comprehensive problems, mathematical and scientific reasoning, logic puzzles, general visual question answering, subjective experience and instruction following, multilingual text recognition and chart/document parsing, 2D/3D object grounding, multi-image understanding, embodied and spatial perception, video understanding, agent task execution, and code generation. Overall, Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct achieves top performance on most metrics among non-reasoning models, significantly outperforming closed-source models such as Gemini 2.5 Pro and GPT-5, while also setting new state-of-the-art results among open-source multimodal models, demonstrating its strong generalization ability and comprehensive performance on complex visual tasks.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-VL/table_nothinking_vl.jpg#center","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-VL/table_nothinking_vl.jpg#center\" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"In terms of reasoning models, Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Thinking also sets new records on most metrics among open-source multimodal models, showing competitive performance against top closed-source models like Gemini 2.5 Pro and GPT-5. Notably, on complex multimodal math problems such as Mathvision, it even outperforms Gemini 2.5 Pro. Although it still lags behind closed-source SOTA models in multidisciplinary problems, visual reasoning, and video understanding, it demonstrates clear advantages in agent capabilities, document understanding, and 2D/3D grounding tasks.","text":"In terms of reasoning models, Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Thinking also sets new records on most metrics among open-source multimodal models, showing competitive performance against top closed-source models like Gemini 2.5 Pro and GPT-5. Notably, on complex multimodal math problems such as Mathvision, it even outperforms Gemini 2.5 Pro. Although it still lags behind closed-source SOTA models in multidisciplinary problems, visual reasoning, and video understanding, it demonstrates clear advantages in agent capabilities, document understanding, and 2D/3D grounding tasks.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"In terms of reasoning models, Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Thinking also sets new records on most metrics among open-source multimodal models, showing competitive performance against top closed-source models like Gemini 2.5 Pro and GPT-5. Notably, on complex multimodal math problems such as Mathvision, it even outperforms Gemini 2.5 Pro. Although it still lags behind closed-source SOTA models in multidisciplinary problems, visual reasoning, and video understanding, it demonstrates clear advantages in agent capabilities, document understanding, and 2D/3D grounding tasks.","text":"In terms of reasoning models, Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Thinking also sets new records on most metrics among open-source multimodal models, showing competitive performance against top closed-source models like Gemini 2.5 Pro and GPT-5. Notably, on complex multimodal math problems such as Mathvision, it even outperforms Gemini 2.5 Pro. Although it still lags behind closed-source SOTA models in multidisciplinary problems, visual reasoning, and video understanding, it demonstrates clear advantages in agent capabilities, document understanding, and 2D/3D grounding tasks.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-VL/table_thinking_vl.jpg#center","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-VL/table_thinking_vl.jpg#center\" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"On text-centric tasks, both Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct and Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Thinking demonstrate strong performance, comparable to the language model Qwen3-235B-A22B-2507.","text":"On text-centric tasks, both Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct and Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Thinking demonstrate strong performance, comparable to the language model Qwen3-235B-A22B-2507.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"On text-centric tasks, both Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct and Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Thinking demonstrate strong performance, comparable to the language model Qwen3-235B-A22B-2507.","text":"On text-centric tasks, both Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct and Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Thinking demonstrate strong performance, comparable to the language model Qwen3-235B-A22B-2507.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-VL/table_nothinking_text.jpg#center","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-VL/table_nothinking_text.jpg#center\" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-VL/table_thinking_text.jpg#center","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-VL/table_thinking_text.jpg#center\" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Additionally, **Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct** supports image-based reasoning with tool use. We tested this on four fine-grained perception and embodied interaction tasks. Results show consistent performance gains across all four benchmarks — proving that combining “image analysis + tool calling” is key to boosting visual perception.","text":"Additionally, **Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct** supports image-based reasoning with tool use. We tested this on four fine-grained perception and embodied interaction tasks. Results show consistent performance gains across all four benchmarks — proving that combining “image analysis + tool calling” is key to boosting visual perception.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Additionally, ","text":"Additionally, ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct**","text":"Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct","text":"Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":" supports image-based reasoning with tool use. We tested this on four fine-grained perception and embodied interaction tasks. Results show consistent performance gains across all four benchmarks — proving that combining “image analysis + tool calling” is key to boosting visual perception.","text":" supports image-based reasoning with tool use. We tested this on four fine-grained perception and embodied interaction tasks. Results show consistent performance gains across all four benchmarks — proving that combining “image analysis + tool calling” is key to boosting visual perception.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-VL/thinking_with_image.jpeg#center","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-VL/thinking_with_image.jpeg#center\" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"In long-context testing, we ran a “needle-in-a-haystack” experiment using ultra-long videos. Results show 100% accuracy with 256K context length. Even when expanded to 1M tokens, equivalent to approximately two hours of continuous video, accuracy remains at 99.5% — demonstrating extremely strong long-sequence modeling ability.","text":"In long-context testing, we ran a “needle-in-a-haystack” experiment using ultra-long videos. Results show 100% accuracy with 256K context length. Even when expanded to 1M tokens, equivalent to approximately two hours of continuous video, accuracy remains at 99.5% — demonstrating extremely strong long-sequence modeling ability.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"In long-context testing, we ran a “needle-in-a-haystack” experiment using ultra-long videos. Results show 100% accuracy with 256K context length. Even when expanded to 1M tokens, equivalent to approximately two hours of continuous video, accuracy remains at 99.5% — demonstrating extremely strong long-sequence modeling ability.","text":"In long-context testing, we ran a “needle-in-a-haystack” experiment using ultra-long videos. Results show 100% accuracy with 256K context length. Even when expanded to 1M tokens, equivalent to approximately two hours of continuous video, accuracy remains at 99.5% — demonstrating extremely strong long-sequence modeling ability.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-VL/haystack_performance.jpg#center","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-VL/haystack_performance.jpg#center\" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"To test multilingual text recognition beyond Chinese and English, we built a test set with 39 languages. The model achieves over 70% accuracy in 32 of them — reaching practical usability and showing strong multilingual generalization.","text":"To test multilingual text recognition beyond Chinese and English, we built a test set with 39 languages. The model achieves over 70% accuracy in 32 of them — reaching practical usability and showing strong multilingual generalization.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"To test multilingual text recognition beyond Chinese and English, we built a test set with 39 languages. The model achieves over 70% accuracy in 32 of them — reaching practical usability and showing strong multilingual generalization.","text":"To test multilingual text recognition beyond Chinese and English, we built a test set with 39 languages. The model achieves over 70% accuracy in 32 of them — reaching practical usability and showing strong multilingual generalization.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-VL/Multilingual_OCR.png#center","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-VL/Multilingual_OCR.png#center\" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"## Model Updates\n\n","depth":2,"text":"Model Updates","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Model Updates","text":"Model Updates","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"In terms of architecture, we still adopt the native dynamic resolution design, but we have updated the structural design in three aspects:","text":"In terms of architecture, we still adopt the native dynamic resolution design, but we have updated the structural design in three aspects:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"In terms of architecture, we still adopt the native dynamic resolution design, but we have updated the structural design in three aspects:","text":"In terms of architecture, we still adopt the native dynamic resolution design, but we have updated the structural design in three aspects:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-VL/qwen3vl_arc.jpg#center","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-VL/qwen3vl_arc.jpg#center\" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"First, we employ **Interleaved-MRoPE**. The original MRoPE divides the feature dimensions into blocks along the order of time (t), height (h), and width (w), causing all temporal information to be concentrated in high-frequency dimensions. In Qwen3-VL, we instead distribute t, h, and w in an interleaved manner, achieving full-frequency coverage across time, height, and width. This more robust positional encoding ensures comparable image understanding capability while significantly improving long video comprehension.","text":"First, we employ **Interleaved-MRoPE**. The original MRoPE divides the feature dimensions into blocks along the order of time (t), height (h), and width (w), causing all temporal information to be concentrated in high-frequency dimensions. In Qwen3-VL, we instead distribute t, h, and w in an interleaved manner, achieving full-frequency coverage across time, height, and width. This more robust positional encoding ensures comparable image understanding capability while significantly improving long video comprehension.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"First, we employ ","text":"First, we employ ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**Interleaved-MRoPE**","text":"Interleaved-MRoPE","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Interleaved-MRoPE","text":"Interleaved-MRoPE","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":". The original MRoPE divides the feature dimensions into blocks along the order of time (t), height (h), and width (w), causing all temporal information to be concentrated in high-frequency dimensions. In Qwen3-VL, we instead distribute t, h, and w in an interleaved manner, achieving full-frequency coverage across time, height, and width. This more robust positional encoding ensures comparable image understanding capability while significantly improving long video comprehension.","text":". The original MRoPE divides the feature dimensions into blocks along the order of time (t), height (h), and width (w), causing all temporal information to be concentrated in high-frequency dimensions. In Qwen3-VL, we instead distribute t, h, and w in an interleaved manner, achieving full-frequency coverage across time, height, and width. This more robust positional encoding ensures comparable image understanding capability while significantly improving long video comprehension.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Second, we introduce DeepStack technology to fuse multi-level features from ViT, enhancing visual detail capture and text-image alignment accuracy. Following the core idea of **DeepStack**, we shift from the conventional multimodal large model (LMM) practice of injecting visual tokens into only a single layer, to injecting them across multiple layers of the large language model (LLM). This multi-layer injection approach enables finer-grained visual understanding. Furthermore, we optimize the visual feature tokenization strategy: visual features extracted from different ViT layers are tokenized and used as visual inputs. This design effectively preserves rich visual information ranging from low-level to high-level features. Experimental results demonstrate significant performance improvements across various visual understanding tasks.","text":"Second, we introduce DeepStack technology to fuse multi-level features from ViT, enhancing visual detail capture and text-image alignment accuracy. Following the core idea of **DeepStack**, we shift from the conventional multimodal large model (LMM) practice of injecting visual tokens into only a single layer, to injecting them across multiple layers of the large language model (LLM). This multi-layer injection approach enables finer-grained visual understanding. Furthermore, we optimize the visual feature tokenization strategy: visual features extracted from different ViT layers are tokenized and used as visual inputs. This design effectively preserves rich visual information ranging from low-level to high-level features. Experimental results demonstrate significant performance improvements across various visual understanding tasks.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Second, we introduce DeepStack technology to fuse multi-level features from ViT, enhancing visual detail capture and text-image alignment accuracy. Following the core idea of ","text":"Second, we introduce DeepStack technology to fuse multi-level features from ViT, enhancing visual detail capture and text-image alignment accuracy. Following the core idea of ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**DeepStack**","text":"DeepStack","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"DeepStack","text":"DeepStack","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":", we shift from the conventional multimodal large model (LMM) practice of injecting visual tokens into only a single layer, to injecting them across multiple layers of the large language model (LLM). This multi-layer injection approach enables finer-grained visual understanding. Furthermore, we optimize the visual feature tokenization strategy: visual features extracted from different ViT layers are tokenized and used as visual inputs. This design effectively preserves rich visual information ranging from low-level to high-level features. Experimental results demonstrate significant performance improvements across various visual understanding tasks.","text":", we shift from the conventional multimodal large model (LMM) practice of injecting visual tokens into only a single layer, to injecting them across multiple layers of the large language model (LLM). This multi-layer injection approach enables finer-grained visual understanding. Furthermore, we optimize the visual feature tokenization strategy: visual features extracted from different ViT layers are tokenized and used as visual inputs. This design effectively preserves rich visual information ranging from low-level to high-level features. Experimental results demonstrate significant performance improvements across various visual understanding tasks.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Third, we upgrade the original video temporal modeling mechanism, T-RoPE, to a **text-timestamp alignment mechanism**. This mechanism adopts an interleaved input format of “timestamps-video frames”, enabling fine-grained alignment between frame-level temporal information and visual content. Additionally, the model natively supports two time output formats: “seconds” and “hours:minutes:seconds” (HMS). This improvement substantially enhances the model’s semantic perception and temporal localization accuracy for actions and events in videos, resulting in more robust performance and precise responses in complex temporal reasoning tasks—such as event localization, action boundary detection, and cross-modal temporal question answering.","text":"Third, we upgrade the original video temporal modeling mechanism, T-RoPE, to a **text-timestamp alignment mechanism**. This mechanism adopts an interleaved input format of “timestamps-video frames”, enabling fine-grained alignment between frame-level temporal information and visual content. Additionally, the model natively supports two time output formats: “seconds” and “hours:minutes:seconds” (HMS). This improvement substantially enhances the model’s semantic perception and temporal localization accuracy for actions and events in videos, resulting in more robust performance and precise responses in complex temporal reasoning tasks—such as event localization, action boundary detection, and cross-modal temporal question answering.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Third, we upgrade the original video temporal modeling mechanism, T-RoPE, to a ","text":"Third, we upgrade the original video temporal modeling mechanism, T-RoPE, to a ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**text-timestamp alignment mechanism**","text":"text-timestamp alignment mechanism","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"text-timestamp alignment mechanism","text":"text-timestamp alignment mechanism","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":". This mechanism adopts an interleaved input format of “timestamps-video frames”, enabling fine-grained alignment between frame-level temporal information and visual content. Additionally, the model natively supports two time output formats: “seconds” and “hours:minutes:seconds” (HMS). This improvement substantially enhances the model’s semantic perception and temporal localization accuracy for actions and events in videos, resulting in more robust performance and precise responses in complex temporal reasoning tasks—such as event localization, action boundary detection, and cross-modal temporal question answering.","text":". This mechanism adopts an interleaved input format of “timestamps-video frames”, enabling fine-grained alignment between frame-level temporal information and visual content. Additionally, the model natively supports two time output formats: “seconds” and “hours:minutes:seconds” (HMS). This improvement substantially enhances the model’s semantic perception and temporal localization accuracy for actions and events in videos, resulting in more robust performance and precise responses in complex temporal reasoning tasks—such as event localization, action boundary detection, and cross-modal temporal question answering.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"## Model Capabilities\n\n","depth":2,"text":"Model Capabilities","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Model Capabilities","text":"Model Capabilities","escaped":false}]},{"type":"heading","raw":"### 1. Visual Agent  \n","depth":3,"text":"1. Visual Agent","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"1. Visual Agent","text":"1. Visual Agent","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Qwen3-VL can not only understand images but also operate smartphones and computers like a human, automating many daily tasks. For example, it can open apps, tap buttons, or fill in forms—enabling intelligent interaction and automation.","text":"Qwen3-VL can not only understand images but also operate smartphones and computers like a human, automating many daily tasks. For example, it can open apps, tap buttons, or fill in forms—enabling intelligent interaction and automation.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3-VL can not only understand images but also operate smartphones and computers like a human, automating many daily tasks. For example, it can open apps, tap buttons, or fill in forms—enabling intelligent interaction and automation.","text":"Qwen3-VL can not only understand images but also operate smartphones and computers like a human, automating many daily tasks. For example, it can open apps, tap buttons, or fill in forms—enabling intelligent interaction and automation.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"demo","name":"datablock","raw":"{{< datablock type=\"demo\" class=\"example-container\" >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/agent_android.json\" hide=false next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/agent_ubuntu.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< /datablock >}}","attributes":{},"children":[{"type":"data","name":"data","raw":"{{< data src=\"./demos/agent_android.json\" hide=false next=true scroll=true >}}\n","attributes":{"scroll":"true"},"hide":"false","next":"true","src":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3-vl/demos/agent_android.json"},{"type":"data","name":"data","raw":"{{< data src=\"./demos/agent_ubuntu.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}","attributes":{"scroll":"true"},"hide":"true","next":"true","src":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3-vl/demos/agent_ubuntu.json"}],"class":"example-container"},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hr","raw":"---"},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"### 2. Think with Images  \n","depth":3,"text":"2. Think with Images","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"2. Think with Images","text":"2. Think with Images","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Qwen3-VL can carefully examine image details—just like humans—and use tools to perform complex reasoning. For instance, it can determine location by reading street signs or identify people from partial photos, completing fine-grained recognition and logical analysis tasks.","text":"Qwen3-VL can carefully examine image details—just like humans—and use tools to perform complex reasoning. For instance, it can determine location by reading street signs or identify people from partial photos, completing fine-grained recognition and logical analysis tasks.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3-VL can carefully examine image details—just like humans—and use tools to perform complex reasoning. For instance, it can determine location by reading street signs or identify people from partial photos, completing fine-grained recognition and logical analysis tasks.","text":"Qwen3-VL can carefully examine image details—just like humans—and use tools to perform complex reasoning. For instance, it can determine location by reading street signs or identify people from partial photos, completing fine-grained recognition and logical analysis tasks.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"demo","name":"datablock","raw":"{{< datablock type=\"demo\" class=\"example-container\" >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/reasoning_with_image1.json\" hide=false next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/reasoning_with_image2.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/reasoning_with_image3.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/reasoning_with_image4.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/reasoning_with_image5.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< /datablock >}}","attributes":{},"children":[{"type":"data","name":"data","raw":"{{< data src=\"./demos/reasoning_with_image1.json\" hide=false next=true scroll=true >}}\n","attributes":{"scroll":"true"},"hide":"false","next":"true","src":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3-vl/demos/reasoning_with_image1.json"},{"type":"data","name":"data","raw":"{{< data src=\"./demos/reasoning_with_image2.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n","attributes":{"scroll":"true"},"hide":"true","next":"true","src":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3-vl/demos/reasoning_with_image2.json"},{"type":"data","name":"data","raw":"{{< data src=\"./demos/reasoning_with_image3.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n","attributes":{"scroll":"true"},"hide":"true","next":"true","src":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3-vl/demos/reasoning_with_image3.json"},{"type":"data","name":"data","raw":"{{< data src=\"./demos/reasoning_with_image4.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n","attributes":{"scroll":"true"},"hide":"true","next":"true","src":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3-vl/demos/reasoning_with_image4.json"},{"type":"data","name":"data","raw":"{{< data src=\"./demos/reasoning_with_image5.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}","attributes":{"scroll":"true"},"hide":"true","next":"true","src":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3-vl/demos/reasoning_with_image5.json"}],"class":"example-container"},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hr","raw":"---"},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"### 3. Code Programming  \n","depth":3,"text":"3. Code Programming","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"3. Code Programming","text":"3. Code Programming","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"By combining visual understanding with code generation, Qwen3-VL shows strong potential in frontend development. It can turn hand-drawn sketches into web pages or help debug UI issues, improving development efficiency.","text":"By combining visual understanding with code generation, Qwen3-VL shows strong potential in frontend development. It can turn hand-drawn sketches into web pages or help debug UI issues, improving development efficiency.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"By combining visual understanding with code generation, Qwen3-VL shows strong potential in frontend development. It can turn hand-drawn sketches into web pages or help debug UI issues, improving development efficiency.","text":"By combining visual understanding with code generation, Qwen3-VL shows strong potential in frontend development. It can turn hand-drawn sketches into web pages or help debug UI issues, improving development efficiency.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"demo","name":"datablock","raw":"{{< datablock type=\"demo\" class=\"example-container\" >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/code1.json\" hide=false next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/code2.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/code3.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/code4.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< /datablock >}}","attributes":{},"children":[{"type":"data","name":"data","raw":"{{< data src=\"./demos/code1.json\" hide=false next=true scroll=true >}}\n","attributes":{"scroll":"true"},"hide":"false","next":"true","src":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3-vl/demos/code1.json"},{"type":"data","name":"data","raw":"{{< data src=\"./demos/code2.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n","attributes":{"scroll":"true"},"hide":"true","next":"true","src":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3-vl/demos/code2.json"},{"type":"data","name":"data","raw":"{{< data src=\"./demos/code3.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n","attributes":{"scroll":"true"},"hide":"true","next":"true","src":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3-vl/demos/code3.json"},{"type":"data","name":"data","raw":"{{< data src=\"./demos/code4.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}","attributes":{"scroll":"true"},"hide":"true","next":"true","src":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3-vl/demos/code4.json"}],"class":"example-container"},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hr","raw":"---"},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"### 4. Spatial Understanding  \n","depth":3,"text":"4. Spatial Understanding","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"4. Spatial Understanding","text":"4. Spatial Understanding","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Qwen3-VL can interpret spatial relationships from images and videos, recognizing directions, actions, and motion patterns. It can also plan future movements—laying the foundation for robotics, autonomous navigation, and embodied AI applications.","text":"Qwen3-VL can interpret spatial relationships from images and videos, recognizing directions, actions, and motion patterns. It can also plan future movements—laying the foundation for robotics, autonomous navigation, and embodied AI applications.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3-VL can interpret spatial relationships from images and videos, recognizing directions, actions, and motion patterns. It can also plan future movements—laying the foundation for robotics, autonomous navigation, and embodied AI applications.","text":"Qwen3-VL can interpret spatial relationships from images and videos, recognizing directions, actions, and motion patterns. It can also plan future movements—laying the foundation for robotics, autonomous navigation, and embodied AI applications.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"demo","name":"datablock","raw":"{{< datablock type=\"demo\" class=\"example-container\" >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/spatio1.json\" hide=false next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/spatio2.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/spatio3.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/spatio4.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/spatio5.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/spatio6.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/spatio7.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< /datablock >}}","attributes":{},"children":[{"type":"data","name":"data","raw":"{{< data src=\"./demos/spatio1.json\" hide=false next=true scroll=true >}}\n","attributes":{"scroll":"true"},"hide":"false","next":"true","src":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3-vl/demos/spatio1.json"},{"type":"data","name":"data","raw":"{{< data src=\"./demos/spatio2.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n","attributes":{"scroll":"true"},"hide":"true","next":"true","src":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3-vl/demos/spatio2.json"},{"type":"data","name":"data","raw":"{{< data src=\"./demos/spatio3.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n","attributes":{"scroll":"true"},"hide":"true","next":"true","src":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3-vl/demos/spatio3.json"},{"type":"data","name":"data","raw":"{{< data src=\"./demos/spatio4.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n","attributes":{"scroll":"true"},"hide":"true","next":"true","src":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3-vl/demos/spatio4.json"},{"type":"data","name":"data","raw":"{{< data src=\"./demos/spatio5.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n","attributes":{"scroll":"true"},"hide":"true","next":"true","src":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3-vl/demos/spatio5.json"},{"type":"data","name":"data","raw":"{{< data src=\"./demos/spatio6.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n","attributes":{"scroll":"true"},"hide":"true","next":"true","src":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3-vl/demos/spatio6.json"},{"type":"data","name":"data","raw":"{{< data src=\"./demos/spatio7.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}","attributes":{"scroll":"true"},"hide":"true","next":"true","src":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3-vl/demos/spatio7.json"}],"class":"example-container"},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hr","raw":"---"},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"### 5. 2D/3D Grounding  \n","depth":3,"text":"5. 2D/3D Grounding","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"5. 2D/3D Grounding","text":"5. 2D/3D Grounding","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Qwen3-VL excels at locating objects in complex scenes with multiple items, accurately generating up to hundreds of detection boxes. The coordinate representation of 2D grounding changes from absolute coordinates to relative coordinates. It also supports 3D bounding box prediction, estimating the real-world position, size, and depth of objects.","text":"Qwen3-VL excels at locating objects in complex scenes with multiple items, accurately generating up to hundreds of detection boxes. The coordinate representation of 2D grounding changes from absolute coordinates to relative coordinates. It also supports 3D bounding box prediction, estimating the real-world position, size, and depth of objects.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3-VL excels at locating objects in complex scenes with multiple items, accurately generating up to hundreds of detection boxes. The coordinate representation of 2D grounding changes from absolute coordinates to relative coordinates. It also supports 3D bounding box prediction, estimating the real-world position, size, and depth of objects.","text":"Qwen3-VL excels at locating objects in complex scenes with multiple items, accurately generating up to hundreds of detection boxes. The coordinate representation of 2D grounding changes from absolute coordinates to relative coordinates. It also supports 3D bounding box prediction, estimating the real-world position, size, and depth of objects.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"demo","name":"datablock","raw":"{{< datablock type=\"demo\" class=\"example-container\" >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/2d_grounding1.json\" hide=false next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/2d_grounding2.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/2d_grounding3.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/2d_grounding4.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/2d_grounding5.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/2d_grounding6.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/3d_grounding1