,"text":"Rich visual knowledge is key to understanding the world. Qwen3-VL can accurately recognize celebrities, food, plants, animals, car brands, and anime characters—providing practical assistance in everyday life, education, and social interactions.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"demo","name":"datablock","raw":"{{< datablock type=\"demo\" class=\"example-container\" >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/omni_recognition1.json\" hide=false next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/omni_recognition3.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/omni_recognition4.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/omni_recognition5.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< /datablock >}}","attributes":{},"children":[{"type":"data","name":"data","raw":"{{< data src=\"./demos/omni_recognition1.json\" hide=false next=true scroll=true >}}\n","attributes":{"scroll":"true"},"hide":"false","next":"true","src":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3-vl/demos/omni_recognition1.json"},{"type":"data","name":"data","raw":"{{< data src=\"./demos/omni_recognition3.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n","attributes":{"scroll":"true"},"hide":"true","next":"true","src":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3-vl/demos/omni_recognition3.json"},{"type":"data","name":"data","raw":"{{< data src=\"./demos/omni_recognition4.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n","attributes":{"scroll":"true"},"hide":"true","next":"true","src":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3-vl/demos/omni_recognition4.json"},{"type":"data","name":"data","raw":"{{< data src=\"./demos/omni_recognition5.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}","attributes":{"scroll":"true"},"hide":"true","next":"true","src":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3-vl/demos/omni_recognition5.json"}],"class":"example-container"},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hr","raw":"---"},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"### 7. Creative Writing  \n","depth":3,"text":"7. Creative Writing","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"7. Creative Writing","text":"7. Creative Writing","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Qwen3-VL’s writing ability has improved significantly. It can generate vivid descriptions based on images or videos, supporting storytelling, copywriting, and video script creation.","text":"Qwen3-VL’s writing ability has improved significantly. It can generate vivid descriptions based on images or videos, supporting storytelling, copywriting, and video script creation.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3-VL’s writing ability has improved significantly. It can generate vivid descriptions based on images or videos, supporting storytelling, copywriting, and video script creation.","text":"Qwen3-VL’s writing ability has improved significantly. It can generate vivid descriptions based on images or videos, supporting storytelling, copywriting, and video script creation.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"demo","name":"datablock","raw":"{{< datablock type=\"demo\" class=\"example-container\" >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/creative_writing_with_image1.json\" hide=false next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/creative_writing_with_image2.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< /datablock >}}","attributes":{},"children":[{"type":"data","name":"data","raw":"{{< data src=\"./demos/creative_writing_with_image1.json\" hide=false next=true scroll=true >}}\n","attributes":{"scroll":"true"},"hide":"false","next":"true","src":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3-vl/demos/creative_writing_with_image1.json"},{"type":"data","name":"data","raw":"{{< data src=\"./demos/creative_writing_with_image2.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}","attributes":{"scroll":"true"},"hide":"true","next":"true","src":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3-vl/demos/creative_writing_with_image2.json"}],"class":"example-container"},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hr","raw":"---"},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"### 8. STEM and Multi-Disciplinary Problem Solving  \n","depth":3,"text":"8. STEM and Multi-Disciplinary Problem Solving","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"8. STEM and Multi-Disciplinary Problem Solving","text":"8. STEM and Multi-Disciplinary Problem Solving","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Qwen3-VL shows stronger capabilities in solving problems across math, physics, chemistry, and other STEM fields. It understands questions, performs step-by-step reasoning, verifies results, and effectively solves academic and real-world scientific challenges.","text":"Qwen3-VL shows stronger capabilities in solving problems across math, physics, chemistry, and other STEM fields. It understands questions, performs step-by-step reasoning, verifies results, and effectively solves academic and real-world scientific challenges.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3-VL shows stronger capabilities in solving problems across math, physics, chemistry, and other STEM fields. It understands questions, performs step-by-step reasoning, verifies results, and effectively solves academic and real-world scientific challenges.","text":"Qwen3-VL shows stronger capabilities in solving problems across math, physics, chemistry, and other STEM fields. It understands questions, performs step-by-step reasoning, verifies results, and effectively solves academic and real-world scientific challenges.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"demo","name":"datablock","raw":"{{< datablock type=\"demo\" class=\"example-container\" >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/stem1.json\" hide=false next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/stem2.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/stem3.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/stem5.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/stem_think1.json\" hide=true next=true scroll=true >}}\n{{< data src=\"./demos/ste